This contribution was produced by Nick Petalas.

The new construction builds directly on unpaidmoon's rank-32 P120 pattern
and open rank-31 question, PR #7087 at
043b334e7249e8b79e437a0765773a7e2fc8b8e8, and its quadratic predecessor #6953.
The unrestricted rank-15 clique construction is unpaidmoon's PR #7014.
The port-window model and port family are DreamingOfClouds's #6933.
unpaidmoon's #6946 supplies the earlier odd-characteristic upper bounds.
The fractional Haemers framework is due to Blasiak and Haemers, with the
cited formulation by Bukh and Cox. Classical finite-field linear algebra
retains its prior credit. No predecessor code is included in this package.
